{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20031","headline":"吴安西馆赠从弟楚客 · 孟郊","name":"吴安西馆赠从弟楚客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蒙笼杨柳馆，中有南风生。\n风生今爲谁，湘客多远情。\n孤枕楚水梦，独帆楚江程。\n觉来残恨深，尚与归路幷。\n玉匣五弦在，请君时一鸣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}